/nscp/releases/tag/0.19.0", "published_at": "2026-09-07T13:28:15Z", "body": "# A real `nscp test` prompt, a crash fix for service filters\r\n\r\n0.19.0 gives the interactive console a proper prompt \u2014 line editing, history,\r\ntab completion and highlighting \u2014 and fixes a heap-corruption crash that took\r\nthe whole agent down whenever a `check_service` filter matched nothing (#1499).\r\nA whole-codebase security review closed three findings: a client module's\r\nconfigured credential could be sent to a caller-chosen host, REST script\r\nuploads were staged at a predictable path, and a", "assets": [{"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-docs.zip", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-docs.zip", "size": 3700642}, {"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-rocky-10-aarch64.rpm", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-rocky-10-aarch64.rpm", "size": 15696884}, {"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-rocky-10-x86_64.rpm", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-rocky-10-x86_64.rpm", "size": 16651371}, {"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-rocky-9-aarch64.rpm", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-rocky-9-aarch64.rpm", "size": 15273332}, {"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-rocky-9-x86_64.rpm", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-rocky-9-x86_64.rpm", "size": 15907297}, {"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-ubuntu-24.04-amd64.deb", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-ubuntu-24.04-amd64.deb", "size": 30779736}, {"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-ubuntu-24.04-arm64.deb", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-ubuntu-24.04-arm64.deb", "size": 29383374}, {"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-Win32-legacy-xp.msi", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-Win32-legacy-xp.msi", "size": 90226688}, {"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-Win32-legacy-xp.zip", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-Win32-legacy-xp.zip", "size": 99541505}, {"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-Win32.msi", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-Win32.msi", "size": 66904064}, {"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-Win32.zip", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-Win32.zip", "size": 72551982}, {"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-x64.msi", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-x64.msi", "size": 82874368}, {"name": "NSCP-0.19.0-x64.zip", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-0.19.0-x64.zip", "size": 88498567}, {"name": "NSCP-Web-0.19.0.sha256", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-Web-0.19.0.sha256", "size": 86}, {"name": "NSCP-Web-0.19.0.zip", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.19.0/NSCP-Web-0.19.0.zip", "size": 1247898}]}, {"tag_name": "0.18.1", "name": "0.18.1", "html_url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/tag/0.18.1", "published_at": "2026-08-31T08:22:33Z", "body": "# Security hardening and bugfixes of monitoring clients\r\n\r\n0.18.1 is a security and correctness release for the passive/outbound side of\r\nthe agent. A review pass over the client modules \u2014 Icinga, NRDP, NSCA, NSCA-NG,\r\ncheck_mk, Elastic, Graphite, syslog, and a second round on SMTP \u2014 turned up the\r\nsame three shapes over and over: **configuration that parsed fine and was then\r\nthrown away**, **network operations that could never time out**, and\r\n**attacker-influenced text reaching another system", "assets": [{"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-docs.zip", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-docs.zip", "size": 3534853}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-rocky-10-aarch64.rpm", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-rocky-10-aarch64.rpm", "size": 15455590}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-rocky-10-x86_64.rpm", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-rocky-10-x86_64.rpm", "size": 16394717}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-rocky-9-aarch64.rpm", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-rocky-9-aarch64.rpm", "size": 15013176}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-rocky-9-x86_64.rpm", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-rocky-9-x86_64.rpm", "size": 15626534}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-ubuntu-24.04-amd64.deb", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-ubuntu-24.04-amd64.deb", "size": 30391482}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-ubuntu-24.04-arm64.deb", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-ubuntu-24.04-arm64.deb", "size": 28980576}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-Win32-legacy-xp.msi", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-Win32-legacy-xp.msi", "size": 89972736}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-Win32-legacy-xp.zip", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-Win32-legacy-xp.zip", "size": 99046136}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-Win32.msi", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-Win32.msi", "size": 66650112}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-Win32.zip", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-Win32.zip", "size": 72068049}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-x64.msi", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-x64.msi", "size": 82595840}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.1-x64.zip", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-0.18.1-x64.zip", "size": 87956425}, {"name": "NSCP-Web-0.18.1.sha256", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-Web-0.18.1.sha256", "size": 86}, {"name": "NSCP-Web-0.18.1.zip", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.1/NSCP-Web-0.18.1.zip", "size": 1247898}]}, {"tag_name": "0.18.0", "name": "0.18.0", "html_url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/tag/0.18.0", "published_at": "2026-08-29T18:08:32Z", "body": "# Fixed some exotic passive checks, and security hardening\r\n\r\nMost of 0.18.0 is about things that reported success while doing nothing.\r\n`check_and_forward` built its submission in a form no channel could read,\r\n`check_nscp` had counted zero crash reports since 0.4.2, and a module enabled by\r\na fleet bundle was never loaded until the service restarted \u2014 all three are\r\nfixed. Security reviews of the SMTP, NRPE, NRDP/NSCA and WEB modules landed\r\nalongside them, and the bundled OpenSSL moves to 3.5", "assets": [{"name": "NSCP-0.18.0-docs.zip", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.0/NSCP-0.18.0-docs.zip", "size": 3499926}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.0-rocky-10-aarch64.rpm", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.0/NSCP-0.18.0-rocky-10-aarch64.rpm", "size": 15371281}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.0-rocky-10-x86_64.rpm", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.0/NSCP-0.18.0-rocky-10-x86_64.rpm", "size": 16298412}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.0-rocky-9-aarch64.rpm", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.0/NSCP-0.18.0-rocky-9-aarch64.rpm", "size": 14935296}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.0-rocky-9-x86_64.rpm", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.0/NSCP-0.18.0-rocky-9-x86_64.rpm", "size": 15524583}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.0-ubuntu-24.04-amd64.deb", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.0/NSCP-0.18.0-ubuntu-24.04-amd64.deb", "size": 30299754}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.0-ubuntu-24.04-arm64.deb", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.0/NSCP-0.18.0-ubuntu-24.04-arm64.deb", "size": 28891698}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.0-Win32-legacy-xp.msi", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.0/NSCP-0.18.0-Win32-legacy-xp.msi", "size": 89812992}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.0-Win32-legacy-xp.zip", "url": "https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/download/0.18.0/NSCP-0.18.0-Win32-legacy-xp.zip", "size": 98935415}, {"name": "NSCP-0.18.0-Win3